@startuml
title ProceduralMaterial と実寸Primitiveの構築順序

top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Yu Gothic UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 24
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor #f7fbff
  FontColor black
}
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam ranksep 22
skinparam nodesep 22

rectangle "Primitive.mapRealCuboid(x, y, z)\n各面の辺長[m]をUVへ記録したModelAsset" as Primitive #eaf7e8
rectangle "new Shape(gpu)" as NewShape
rectangle "shape.applyPrimitiveAsset(asset)\npositions / indices / meter UVを\nCPU配列へコピー" as Apply
rectangle "proceduralMaterials.createPreset(id, { scale })\nColor / Height / Normal textureを生成" as Create #f4edff
rectangle "material.applyTo(shape)\nUV ÷ (tileSizeMeters × scale)\nPBR material parameterを設定" as Material #f4edff
rectangle "shape.endShape()\n換算済みUVを含む頂点bufferをGPUへ転送" as EndShape #fdeaea
rectangle "node.addShape(shape)\nsceneへ配置して描画" as Scene #eaf7e8

Primitive --> Apply
NewShape --> Apply
Create --> Material
Apply --> Material
Material --> EndShape
EndShape --> Scene

note top of Primitive
物体寸法とUVの単位をmeterでそろえる
面ごとに幅と高さを使い分ける
end note

note left of Material
scale 1: presetの実寸
scale 2: textureを2倍の大きさで表示
scale 0.5: textureを半分の大きさで表示
end note

note left of EndShape
scale付きapplyToをこの後に呼ぶと
CPU UVとGPU bufferの不一致で例外
end note
@enduml
